Run web UI tests written in plain-text .whirl files

Usage: whirl <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run         Run files in browsers
  report      Generate HTML from saved results without running browsers
  check       Parse and lint files; nothing runs
  fmt         Rewrite files to the canonical form
  install     Provision the shim bundle and browsers
  doctor      Check the runtime and launch a browser; print repair commands on failure
  show-trace  Open a Playwright trace with Whirl's private runtime
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
